// ConnectionApprovalValue WHO IS WAITED ON, while the connection waits for a second person. Present and `null`
// once approved, and for every connection nobody had to approve.
//
// THIS, AND NOT THE CAUSE, IS WHAT A PROGRAM READS. `not_working_cause` is a sentence
// for a person; a screen decides whether to offer Approve from this field.
