	// vendor's sign-up has the person fill in their company's details. After `expires_at` it is
	// refused (409) and is started again. A token the vendor does not accept is refused (409) too,
	// and nothing is connected. While Onplo's own client for that vendor is not handed to this
	// server, finishing answers 501, as the start does.
