	//
	// "In which Flows deploy environments flows may use it." "It is a LIST of deploy
	// environments, one tick each."
	//
	// WHAT A NEW CONNECTION STARTS WITH is the list Settings → Deploy-environment defaults gives,
	// "empty as shipped, and works in no deploy environment until one is ticked". Empty means
