	// MARKING IT PRODUCTION-READY IS ADDING PRODUCTION TO THIS LIST, "so one mechanism serves two
	// deploy environments and ten: a company with a Staging environment opens Staging without
	// opening Production".
	//
	// A deploy environment is Flows' own; one that is not this account environment's is refused
	// (422 naming it). Whether one is this account environment's is asked of identity, which Flows
	// tells of every deploy environment it makes; identity unreachable is the 503
	// `identity_unavailable`, never read as "not here", and nothing changes (ONPLO-4429).
	//
	// THE WHOLE OF IT IS SENT, and replaces what was there: nothing is merged, so what is left
