	// AFTERWARDS IT READS NOT WORKING, "address changed, not tested yet", until Test passes once:
	// `status: not_working` with that cause, `status_checked_at` the moment of the change, and
	// `expires_at` `null`. Entering the credential again does not lift it. Test does not reach an
	// MCP server yet (ONPLO-4142). A connection waiting for a second person keeps reading so.
