	// ITS OWN PERMISSION (decision 0765): Reconnect a governed system. It "is never an agent's,
	// because it sends an admin of the other system to approve again".
	//
	// A SYSTEM THAT IS APPROVED ANOTHER WAY IS REFUSED with `governed_system_approved_another_way`:
	// a pasted key is pasted again, and a cloud account's role is filled in again.
