	// A DEFAULT FEATURE IS ALWAYS SHOWN: hiding one is refused (409 `always_on`). A PREMIUM
	// FEATURE YOU DO NOT HOLD has nothing to show or hide: either is refused (409 `not_held`).
	//
	// WHEN ACCOUNT CANNOT BE ASKED about a Premium feature, the answer is 503
	// `account_unavailable`, never 409 `not_held` in its place. Nothing changed, and the same
	// request can be sent again. A Default or a Free feature asks Account nothing.
	//
	// A `feature_id` that is not one of Integrations' features in this account environment is 404.
	// Sending the value a feature already has is answered as any other write is, and changes
	// nothing.
