	// A WRITE-ONLY KEYS ENTRY, kept exactly as a generated secret is, and shown to nobody once saved,
	// the person who pasted it included, since the sender still holds it. It passes through here once
	// on its way to the vault, never stored and never logged (decision 0727). So this answer carries
	// no secret.
