	// RotateWebhookSigningSecretWithBody Rotate a webhook endpoint's signing secret
	//
	// ROTATION OVERLAPS INSTEAD OF CUTTING (decision 0453). A new secret is issued while the old
	// one keeps verifying for the window chosen here — 24 hours unless said otherwise, at most
