// ITS OWN PERMISSION, APART FROM READING THE CONNECTION. Reading is an act, and every act is
// its own permission: changing does not carry seeing, and seeing does not carry changing
// (decision 0811, rule 2). So `getConnection` and `listConnections` answer what every call
// carries and what Test asks for, and never where the credential is sent; somebody who may
// read a connection, or change its address, sees the address only when this permission is
// theirs as well.
