// CreateEventSubscriptionWithBody Make an event subscription
//
// ONPLO TELLS AN OUTSIDE ADDRESS WHEN AN EVENT HAPPENS, signed the Standard Webhooks way, and keeps
// trying until it is received.
//
// THE ADDRESS IS CHECKED HERE AND AGAIN AT EVERY SEND. "It must start with `https://`", and "an
// address that resolves to a private or internal network, or to Onplo itself, is refused at save time
// and again at every send" (`address_reaches_inside`). Where the environment keeps an allow-list of
// outside addresses, one not on it is refused the same way (`address_not_allowed`), once that list is
// built (ONPLO-5104). An address whose name resolves to no address at all reaches nothing, and is
// refused too (`address_reaches_nothing`).
