// (`owner_is_another_person`), and a machine must be one of this environment's (`owner_machine_not_here`). "A subscription owned by a member dies with
// them (decision 0436)"; one owned by a machine keeps running when its steward leaves.
//
// THE SIGNING SECRET IS SHOWN ONCE, in this answer, and is then a write-only Keys entry, "shown to
// nobody, Onplo included".
//
// "UP TO 50 SUBSCRIPTIONS PER ENVIRONMENT": a fifty-first is `event_subscriptions_limit_reached`.
//
// A PERSON PRESSES SAVE. "An AI agent may propose one as a draft, but a person presses Save, because a
