// ResumeMachine Resume a paused machine
//
// "Resuming a paused machine lifts a stop on the machine itself. Onplo pauses a machine when its
// reassign ask goes unanswered, or when its steward is suspended and it runs on their own
// device" (decisions 0462 and 0592).
