// WHAT RESUME DOES: "its keys work again, and it takes jobs as before. Its grants, seat and
// pinned role were never touched, so there is nothing to put back." Its steward is told.
//
// APART FROM THE PAUSE ON AI'S BOARD. "That Pause only stops the machine taking jobs, and it is
// lifted on the board. Resume here is a separate act" — this operation never lifts the board's
// Pause, and the board's never lifts this one. It is not the kill-switch either: lifting that is
// `liftMachineAccessSuspension`, for every machine of the environment at once.
//
// ONLY A PERSON MAY DO IT: a machine's key and an agent are refused `403`
// `ring_requires_person`.
