	// DisconnectGovernedSystemWithResponse Disconnect a governed system
	//
	// "A governed system ends as every connection does." Disconnect "destroys Onplo's credential
	// at once, reading stops at that moment, and the row reads DISCONNECTED". The row stays in
	// the list, and the answer is the governed system as it now stands.
