	// A STOP, NEVER A REMOVAL (decision 0765): "Disconnect moves to the same act a connection's
	// has, still inside Manage governed systems, and the deletion is Remove". Taking the row away
	// is `DELETE` on the governed system, and Reconnect in place has its own three operations.
	//
