	// UpdateSignInAppWithBodyWithResponse Change an app's name or its redirect addresses
	//
	// Every field is optional and an omitted field is untouched. A new name is held to the same
	// refusal as at registration (`app_name_impersonates`).
	//
	// "Changing it changes what people agree to when they sign in", which is why no AI agent may
	// do it, at any risk tier: the permission is offered to no agent.
	//
	// Takes any type of body and a specified content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
	//
	// Corresponds with PATCH /sign-in-apps/{sign_in_app_id} (the `UpdateSignInApp` operationId).
