	// A REFUSAL IS LOGGED TOO. One over 5 MiB, or whose signature did not verify, started nothing,
	// and its row says so, with no payload; refusals from one sender within a minute collapse into
	// one row with a count (the spec lane's ruling of 29 October 2026, ONPLO-3737).
