// ITS SEAT IS ACCOUNT'S, NEVER INTEGRATIONS' (the owner's ruling of 16 November 2026, ONPLO-3824).
// A machine's premium seat is assigned by hand in Account → Manage users → Machines, by whoever
// holds the permission to do so. Make a machine takes none, and this operation frees none: the
